Revision history for Data-TopK-Shared

0.02      2026-07-12
          - Add time-decayed mode (new_decayed / new_decayed_memfd): forward
            decay so recent hits outweigh old ones, with an optional per-add
            timestamp. estimate/error/top report decayed counts; is_decayed /
            half_life introspection. Plain mode unchanged and file-compatible.

